    "title": "pandas.Index.get_slice_bound — pandas 1.5.3 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.Index.get_slice_bound#\n\n- \nIndex.get_slice_bound(*label* ,*side* ,*kind=_NoDefault.no_default* )[source]#\n- Calculate slice bound that corresponds to given label. Returns leftmost (one-past-the-rightmost if `side=='right'` ) position\nof given label.\n  - Parameters\n    - **label** object\n    - **side** {‘left’, ‘right’}\n    - **kind** {‘loc’, ‘getitem’} or None\n    - Deprecated since version 1.4.0.\n  - Returns\n    - int\n    - Index of label.",
    "markdown_length": 453,
